block content

    section.source_section
        h2 Base presentational classes variations samples

        h3 Regular unordered List
        markdown
            p In the example below we have a Regular list.
        .source_example
            .ux3
                ul
                    li Nick Gayeski
                    li George Pess
                    li Tim Beechie


        h3 Inline bulleted list ("inline-bullet-list")
        markdown
            p In the example below we have an inline bulleted list with `inline-bullet-list` class.
        .source_example
            .ux3
                ul.rlist.inline-bullet-list
                    li Nick Gayeski
                    li George Pess
                    li Tim Beechie

        h3 left aligned Text (default)
            markdown
                p In the example below we have left aligned text.
            .source_example
                .ux3
                    div
                        span left aligned text (defualt)

        h3 Centered text  ("Centered")
            markdown
                p In the example below we have text with `centered` class.
            .source_example
                .ux3
                    div.centered
                        span centered text






